		(property "Description" "MS2106E is a video and audio capture chip integrating a USB 2.0 controller and data transceiver module, video ADC module, audio ADC module, and audio/video processing module. The MS2106E can transmit CVBS, S-Video, and audio signals to PCs, smartphones, and tablets via USB for preview or capture. MS2106E supports YUV422 and MJPEG output modes, and is compatible with Windows, Android, and macOS systems."
